WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.788
Winedroid runs real

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.345
Android APKs without

00:00:03.157 --> 00:00:03.875
Android

00:00:03.947 --> 00:00:04.548
even

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:06.202
Winedroid is a

00:00:06.013 --> 00:00:07.487
Rust reimplementation

00:00:07.299 --> 00:00:08.100
of the Android

00:00:07.912 --> 00:00:09.256
runtime that runs

00:00:09.068 --> 00:00:10.470
real APKs from

00:00:10.353 --> 00:00:11.992
F-Droid without Android

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.336
a browser demo

00:00:13.148 --> 00:00:14.786
loads a 12 MB

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:16.284
WASM runtime

00:00:16.822 --> 00:00:17.812
The demo runs

00:00:17.624 --> 00:00:18.590
a calculator

00:00:18.662 --> 00:00:19.734
file explorer

00:00:19.817 --> 00:00:21.090
meditation timer

00:00:21.162 --> 00:00:22.376
weather and currency

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:23.472
apps downloaded from

00:00:23.308 --> 00:00:24.156
F-Droid

00:00:24.686 --> 00:00:25.664
The author notes

00:00:25.476 --> 00:00:26.254
it is early

00:00:26.396 --> 00:00:27.315
not every app

00:00:27.127 --> 00:00:28.117
works yet and

00:00:27.929 --> 00:00:28.860
the browser build

00:00:28.672 --> 00:00:29.744
is slower because

00:00:29.556 --> 00:00:30.299
the JIT does

00:00:30.111 --> 00:00:30.794
not work on

00:00:30.606 --> 00:00:31.171
the web

00:00:31.243 --> 00:00:32.433
so native Winedroid

00:00:32.245 --> 00:00:33.129
runs smoother

00:00:33.654 --> 00:00:34.668
Full story on

00:00:34.479 --> 00:00:35.375
the dashboard
